  "title": "Mashed Potato Quesadilla",
  "description": "I had something like this at a restaurant last night and had to try duplicating it at home! This potato quesadilla reminds me of a pierogi! I think this recipe can be played up with just about anything you like with potatoes! This can be a super-fast meal if you use the heat and serve bacon and premade mashed potatoes!",
